<title>FRANCE: Algeria inflation down to 9.8 pct for year to Feb.</title>
<headline>Algeria inflation down to 9.8 pct for year to Feb.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria's inflation rate fell to 9.8 percent for the year to February 1997 from 18 percent in the previous year, Finance Minister Abdelkrim Harchaoui was quoted on Saturday as saying.</p>
<p>&quot;Algeria posts for the first time a one digit inflation rate figure and thus brings the country's inflation rate closer to inflation rates in the European Union countries,&quot; added Harchaoui, quoted by Algerian state-run radio.</p>
</text>
